        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "TripWorld destination check-ins • One visit = one user + one place + one UTC date. Returning = at least 2 distinct visit dates. All-history repeat-visit rate, not 30/90-day cohort retention. Counts across places are **user–place pairs**, so one user visiting two attractions contributes twice. Historical replay: 2017–2018."
      }
    },
